{"id":"4f79806b5dce4a93","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation.md","title":"ZFC Setop Domain Of Relation","display":"df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation — ZFC Setop Domain Of Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation — ZFC Setop Domain Of Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","[[58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-setop-domain-of-relation — ZFC Setop Domain Of Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7cf057d5daacec1\" href=\"?note=c7cf057d5daacec1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code\">58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq V\\times V\">\\(R\\subseteq V\\times V\\)</span> (binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq V\">\\(D\\subseteq V\\)</span> (domain of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in V\">\\(a,b\\in V\\)</span> (coordinates bound in the domain comprehension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopDomainOfRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopDomainOfRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S\\)</span> (bounded relation-domain predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}domain\\text{-}of\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopDomainOfRelation}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}domain\\text{-}of\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopDomainOfRelation}_S(D,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRelDomain}_S(D,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an alias of the bounded domain construction, which also verifies that every element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is an ordered pair.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set12-kuratowski-pair-code","status":